    "递推时未来创新期望为零，区间方差为 σ²Σψ²。区间基于高斯创新，条件于参数估计。": "Future innovations have zero expectation and forecast error variance is σ²Σψ². Prediction intervals assume Gaussian innovations and condition on the estimates.",
