    "检验给定其他变量的滞后后，来源变量的全部 p 个滞后系数是否为零。经典 F 参考分布需要相应误差假设。": "Test whether all p lag coefficients of the source are zero conditional on the other lags. The classical F reference distribution relies on error assumptions.",
